──────────────────── Turn 11 · Quarterly energy allocation ─────────────────────
                          Month 3 · Quarter 1 · Year 1                          

A new quarter begins and you have 3 Energy points. Unused Energy does not roll  
over. Plan your energy actions: you can combine several, as long as the total   
cost is no more than 3, and you can leave some or all of your Energy unused. The
system applies each chosen action’s status_updates to your visible stats.       

Choices:
      [1] High-intensity work — Push hard on delivery. Output rises, Health and 
Dignity fall, and HiddenRisk goes up.
      [2] Skill learning — Spend time learning. Skill rises for the long run, 
but you are tired in the short term.
      [3] Network maintenance — Keep up relationships inside and outside the 
team. Network and Dignity rise slightly.
      [4] Defuse legacy risk — Clear up old problems before they bite. 
HiddenRisk goes down.
      [5] Mental recovery — Take time to reset. Dignity gets a solid boost.
